{"name":"main","commit":{"sha":"f434715f7c664af431f0be62982aa379400102de","node_id":"C_kwDOULC0BtoAKGY0MzQ3MTVmN2M2NjRhZjQzMWYwYmU2Mjk4MmFhMzc5NDAwMTAyZGU","commit":{"author":{"name":"Alexey Zhokhov","email":"alexey@zhokhov.com","date":"2026-09-08T13:43:28Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-09-08T13:43:28Z"},"message":"chore: dissolve shared/references into owning skills (#1)\n\nDelete the wholesale-copied shared/references staging set (6 byte-identical\nfiles propagated into every repo at monorepo split, 73% never cited) and keep\nthe byte-identical skill-local copies as the canonical home:\n\n- runtime-trust.md: existing vendored copies in every skill become canonical\n- contribution-handoff.md: the five tailrocks-contribute-* skills\n- repository-audit-lanes.md: tailrocks-improve and tailrocks-improve-deep\n- version-policy.md: the 13 renamed shared-version-policy.md skill copies\n- design-pipeline.md: the five design skills, which now cite it\n- pr-conventions.md: removed everywhere; the policy is owned by\n  tailrocks-create-pr/references/repo-conventions.md (verified superset)\n\nAlso wire previously implicit citations (design-pipeline in the web, tui and\nmacos design skills plus macos-visual-baseline; version-policy in the tanstack\naudit/remediate/migrate skills with the corrected baseline-reference count),\nadd the waiver-policy paragraph to tailrocks-document, change \"generated\" to\n\"vendored\" in the two surviving repository-audit-lanes copies, and regenerate\ngenerated docs where skill-local files were removed.\n\nSigned-off-by: Alexey Zhokhov <alexey@zhokhov.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fc3068f7d6a76be3c529088aea3937ffc02584fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailrocks/tailrocks-typescript-skills/git/trees/fc3068f7d6a76be3c529088aea3937ffc02584fc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailrocks/tailrocks-typescript-skills/git/commits/f434715f7c664af431f0be62982aa379400102de","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqoBEACRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAANC8QAFMp6IEQQG42YX67cws1rdPv\nDLFHXOfJ8GgF4R52/RcDu8pgQthaktGbKv61uG9qGlXcuqMx3DSmAhh9wHEh2/8J\ns2tuvmrO3nRvm/SL6O4DMG2HjX1ZV9+Jygt9z77xaKLucDq0DZpe8rGRV3A1k9tU\noHEle/fVKri2C2A+9pnfXAidwxeNn+JxAwlUYFmNK9+3Y31rjECcT4LQHJR1KO27\nYKR1pkFwdTJHFsuzro1JW2cTDynXRlbmffI8XsvQA6exul3RbtXtl4rx2aARJxSG\n+maMYPHEe9z0q8ydCU3QSQ09TPmDd4j0yiN/LVC236wEzRPZc/au7cgZW38ARhq2\nLOG4FBls6ZKco1uI09+SxxgsbOVH5O1PLAaOgUnD9auTmPiRxrWRzuczERS0FMRc\n/wgMsyUHvkAkLTC84v4/alG8VwVHsna+3ZOSnbEo2SXTVvb1PEHeknw8qtrDKsxQ\n0euvqoGJ79skDm0jHZt18hooP6rWrwJp4+GO2sYQvf9BxqxfCMuYywlDT4AMBm0C\n46L568UeLQXIuhzMrGIP2a89jJ0gDfNaaf4mwhtS1YYRX4eumqvnzDrbdGuw3Uef\nWxJP7rsuRitnP5IhqTth4KLX126USrLPVR5S+sby1IokgJgrjPjXb0/MSCgLBLDf\nYBhrRruo1u6+htdejWEK\n=oi8J\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree fc3068f7d6a76be3c529088aea3937ffc02584fc\nparent 211fe8a3c59fd54dc11b2e88e4166babdeedb14a\nauthor Alexey Zhokhov <alexey@zhokhov.com> 1788875008 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788875008 +0700\n\nchore: dissolve shared/references into owning skills (#1)\n\nDelete the wholesale-copied shared/references staging set (6 byte-identical\nfiles propagated into every repo at monorepo split, 73% never cited) and keep\nthe byte-identical skill-local copies as the canonical home:\n\n- runtime-trust.md: existing vendored copies in every skill become canonical\n- contribution-handoff.md: the five tailrocks-contribute-* skills\n- repository-audit-lanes.md: tailrocks-improve and tailrocks-improve-deep\n- version-policy.md: the 13 renamed shared-version-policy.md skill copies\n- design-pipeline.md: the five design skills, which now cite it\n- pr-conventions.md: removed everywhere; the policy is owned by\n  tailrocks-create-pr/references/repo-conventions.md (verified superset)\n\nAlso wire previously implicit citations (design-pipeline in the web, tui and\nmacos design skills plus macos-visual-baseline; version-policy in the tanstack\naudit/remediate/migrate skills with the corrected baseline-reference count),\nadd the waiver-policy paragraph to tailrocks-document, change \"generated\" to\n\"vendored\" in the two surviving repository-audit-lanes copies, and regenerate\ngenerated docs where skill-local files were removed.\n\nSigned-off-by: Alexey Zhokhov <alexey@zhokhov.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>","verified_at":"2026-09-08T13:43:29Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailrocks/tailrocks-typescript-skills/commits/f434715f7c664af431f0be62982aa379400102de","html_url":"https://github.com/tailrocks/tailrocks-typescript-skills/commit/f434715f7c664af431f0be62982aa379400102de","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailrocks/tailrocks-typescript-skills/commits/f434715f7c664af431f0be62982aa379400102de/comments","author":{"login":"donbeave","id":139017,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTAxNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/139017?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave","html_url":"https://github.com/donbeave","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":